    "body": "Hi @chipbuster thanks - this causes problems for me though. \r\nShould I change that plugins path to match what mine actually looks like? Here is what was in the `~/.starship.init.tmp` file before I made the changes you suggested, with edits to match: \r\n\r\n```\r\nPROMPT='$(/usr/local/bin/starship prompt --keymap=\"$KEYMAP\" --status=\"$STARSHIP_CMD_STATUS\" --pipestatus ${STARSHIP_PIPE_STATUS[@]} --cmd-duration=\"$STARSHIP_DURATION\" --jobs=\"$STARSHIP_JOBS_COUNT\")'\r\n```\r\nEdited with your instructions to: \r\n```\r\nPROMPT='$(/usr/local/bin/starship---starship/starship prompt --keymap=\"$KEYMAP\" --status=\"${STARSHIP_CMD_STATUS}\" --pipestatus \"${STARSHIP_PIPE_STATUS[@]}\" --cmd-duration=\"$STARSHIP_DURATION\" --jobs=\"$STARSHIP_JOBS_COUNT\")'\r\n```\r\nError: \r\n```\r\nprompt_pure_preprompt_render:61: no such file or directory: /usr/local/bin/starship---starship/starship\r\n\r\nzsh: no such file or directory: /usr/local/bin/starship---starship/starship\r\n~\r\nprompt_pure_preprompt_render:61: no such file or directory: /usr/local/bin/starship---starship/starship\r\n```",
