    "updated_at": "2021-10-05T23:26:36Z",
    "body": "To everyone who's having this issue: the exacct issue is now fixed by #3088. However, you might still see a warning when launching a new shell, since the same issue also deletes the ZSH status code.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I'm not sure how to solve this latter problem, since the warning that it generates is valuable in other cases (if the value of the status code becomes lost or garbled) and I'd rather not completely squelch it if possible. The warning message is a single line, so it should be much less visual noise than the current issue.\r\n\r\nI'm leaving this issue open until we can get that solved as well.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
